The expected values were derived from the Common Terminology Criteria for Adverse Events v5.0 and v6.0, works of
the US National Cancer Institute in the public domain. CDISC controlled terminology codes are used under the CDISC
terms of use for the SDTM terminology published by the NCI Enterprise Vocabulary Services.
